---
description: Preserve reviewed release scope and durable development handoffs.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read AGENTS.md and docs/status.md before work. Follow docs/development.md and
docs/releases/policy.md. release-policy.toml owns the public crate allowlist and
channel; Cargo.toml owns the version. Run just check-release-policy for drift.
Keep planned/FFI packages private and respect the deferred Dart/PostgreSQL scope.
Only reviewed manual workflows publish; ordinary pushes and tags do not upload.
Use existing session authorization without asking for it again. Record source,
checks, limits, and next action in docs/status.md before a context handoff.
